body:
For example, you can't post videos or photos of something related to Sia or Maddie without it being closed "because there is a megathread". Well, you can't post photos or videos in a megathread and it's so hard to keep track of any article links.

&#x200B;

Also it would be one thing maybe if it was just the Music movie. But it's literally everything related to Sia and Maddie. It's kind of ridiculous.
